OL,3,APope Leo to have surgery after lump
OL,4,Afound on lung
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo XIV has announced he will be
OL,7,Foperated "in the coming days" after a
OL,8,Fnodule was found on his lung during a
OL,9,Fmedical check up.
OL,11,F"The doctors found an early,
OL,12,Fwell-localised nodule on my lung," he
OL,13,Ftold the public during his weekly
OL,14,FSunday prayers in St Peter's Square in
OL,15,FRome.
OL,17,FThe 71-year-old pontiff said his
OL,18,Fmedical team "believe it would be right
OL,19,Fto intervene" and he had agreed to the
OL,20,Foperation.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
